    rdfs:comment "No assertion template is declared. The template that would otherwise apply, the published Project Delphi evidence item template https://w3id.org/np/RAk4kcX4zA_touv8CeKku9tTUnbR5xiTLSLwFbrKSl3BE (dct:created 2026-10-01), still carries the legacy https://w3id.org/probknow/ontology/ namespace (1 occurrence, checked 2026-10-31 on the live network), and its required statements cannot be instantiated with Delphi ontology 2.0 terms, so this hand-authored record was not created from it and does not claim to be. The provenance template https://w3id.org/np/RAaYeFYF-Cz2bM5S1wPQsnvs5X6BBxsphL03UkbVZ1lcA is declared because it carries no legacy IRI (0 occurrences, same check). No pubinfo template is declared. See claim-tests/nanopubs/DECISIONS.md (2026-10-31)." .
